# 32. Production Example

```js
const settings = {
    notifications: false
};
```

This is wrong if `false` is a valid user setting:

```js
settings.notifications || true
```

because it produces:

```text
true
```

Correct:

```js
settings.notifications ?? true
```

produces:

```text
false
```

